      "writtenOn": "2026-09-23T10:53:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is GetBootStrapAccount the only path that creates non-IPMI users, or must direct D-Bus user creation also enforce the 15-user limit? If the limit is reached, who rejects the creation and how is ccOutOfSpace propagated?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1868,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 1868,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "6d636392699443a4e24b02ab845837de6c6d4b68",
