      "writtenOn": "2026-10-01T05:46:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "GetBootStrapAccount is the only ipmid path that creates non-IPMI users, but Redfish (AccountTypes without IPMI) and direct D-Bus CreateUser also create them, and all share the same pool.\n\nphosphor-user-manager enforces the limit for every path: throwForMaxGrpUserCount() runs in CreateUser and on UserGroups changes and throws xyz.openbmc_project.User.Common.Error.NoResource. This list mirrors that count so GetBootStrapAccount can return ccOutOfSpace early without a D-Bus round trip; it is not the enforcer. If user-manager rejects anyway, createUser() returns ccUnspecifiedError, the same as any other D-Bus failure in this file.",
      "parentUuid": "7e71fea5_ca9bd26e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1868,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 1868,
        "endChar": 41
      },
